This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:37.680
March, 1586 - Settsu Province, Osaka Castle

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:57.780
Lord Ueda.

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:00.630
I am not used to sneaking around like this.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:09.360
I wonder what business the Chief Advisor has with us so late at night.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.150
Thank you for your hard work, castle guard.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.650
It has been three months since the tea party at the imperial court.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:26.470
I don't understand why people of our caliber are not shown the golden tea room.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:31.330
That is why I want to see it even more now.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.220
In here?

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:50.200
Woman from Nagoya

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.390
Bling! No wait, bling bling!

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:12.220
Gold adorned all over.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:16.500
Strewn with a scarlet felt. This is too fabulous.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:20.660
But under the candle lights deep in the night,

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.640
a mysterious simplicity exists.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.320
In the mornings and afternoons this tea room screams royalty.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:34.460
In the evenings, the tea room becomes bewitching.

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:41.180
This represents the symbiosis between beauty and imperfection!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.010
Master Oribe.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:51.130
We are not anyone suspicious.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:54.240
We brought you some refreshments. Eat up.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:58.330
Thank you very much.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.790
I am sorry to interrupt you like this.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:05.750
But we have to put this away now that the upkeep is done.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:06.840
What!?

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:13.360
Master Oribe...

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.470
I have heard about the tea room being carried into the imperial court.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:24.140
I never realized it can be broken down into pieces.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.410
A portable tea room...

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:38.190
Who thought up this ingenuity?

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.460
Too scary...

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:43.240
Master, you are truly...

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:45.840
...an aesthete of the highest caliber.

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:49.750
Settsu Province, Arima Barracks

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:02.380
If new tea wasn't brought in...

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:05.020
The Emperor would have drank poison.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:12.680
At the time,

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:18.680
the Emperor acknowledged me, from humble origins.

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:22.770
I was unable to act.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.750
You killed Nobunaga, though.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.060
That's exactly the reason.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.280
I do not want to go through that again.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.420
But like what Rikyū said,

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.840
you must control the citizenry.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.040
If the emperor has a change in heart,

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:43.350
and supports Tokugawa or Mōri instead,

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:46.170
Toyotomi's rule will be in danger.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:49.360
Compared to all that,

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:53.310
what's tougher to handle is the emperor's successor, Sanehito Shinnō.

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:59.120
I eliminate Shinnō and prop my own son up. That's when I win.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:04.570
I can become the guardian of Sanpōshi and control the court.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.130
Leave that to me.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:13.030
We also cannot rely only on Sakai anymore for monetary support.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:18.490
We must aim for Kyushu and Hakata in order to support a more stable nation.

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:24.140
Brother!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.800
Have you come to hate Master Rikyū because of this?

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:33.270
Not at all.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:36.710
Chill in the bath a bit longer.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.710
The hot springs of Arima are said to do wonders for your weak body.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:45.640
Tokugawa's head, Ishikawa Kazumasa, is supporting us.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.200
This is all due to Rikyū's efforts.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:53.410
Rikyū possesses great power over the heads of the clans.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.820
You must not treat him lightly.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.280
Toyotomi, he is someone we cannot afford to lose.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.460
I understand, Hidenaga.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:08.480
I understand.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.520
May, 1586 - Tōtōmi Province, Hamamatsu Castle

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:18.020
Praise me, my people.

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:23.730
I, Ieyasu, have finally wed with Hideyoshi's sister, Asahi.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:30.610
Ishikawa has rebelled and now the situation is not in my favor.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:34.150
But perhaps peace will finally come.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.670
Let us have some tea.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.220
Master Rikyū sent us some nice tea.

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.300
Brother is a cold man.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:58.480
He had you leave the family and marry me all for the sake of Tokugawa.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.430
But I, Ieyasu, must do the right thing.

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:09.610
I will only bring myself to confer with Master Hideyoshi.

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.100
I will not fall under him.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.110
I understand how you feel.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.740
Feel free to stay here.

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:21.700
If anything displeases you, please speak out.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:25.990
Oh dear.

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:28.310
I'm using the handle to stir the tea again.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.770
Looks like I am not used to the way of the tea.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.310
How depressing.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:39.850
Is her name, Asahi, just for show?

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:43.800
That is the famed Pot of Shiga.

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:50.170
Ōtomo Sōrin from Bungo means business, letting this be displayed.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:57.490
Ōtomo admires Toyotomi's tenacity.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:00.380
He said that if we can pacify Kyushu,

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:05.480
he will give us one of the three famed Katatsugi tea containers, Nitta.

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:12.340
The Hatsuhana is in your hands already.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:16.590
What remains is the Narashiba, belonging to Hakata's Shimai Soushitsu.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:22.310
Nobunaga's hold of the Triumvirate is coming to an end.

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:25.980
Any word from Ieyasu?

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.480
None at the moment.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:31.100
But with the incident concerning Ishikawa Kazumasa,

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.440
it is only a matter of time before he falls under you.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.410
Just a bit more, huh?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.210
Practice is over.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.610
Step down.

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.840
Mitsunari, I like you.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.190
You never lie to me.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.910
All this may have been painful,

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:51.690
but that is because I dote on you.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:56.250
I will leave Sakai in your hands.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:01.320
Beware of the Sakai merchants. Don't let them cheat the merchants of Hakata.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.970
I'll also leave the monetary matters to you.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:09.100
Perhaps monetary matters are more suited for Master Hidenaga or Master Rikyū?

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.720
Rikyū is gaining too much power.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.180
I am unable to control him anymore.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:20.210
However, Toyotomi must not lack elegance in its rule.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:24.200
We shall give him free reign for now.

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:28.900
Eventually, we'll find a replacement.

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:31.990
Listen up, Mitsunari.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:33.970
Hakata is next.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:40.800
Kyushu will be my starting point for Korea and China.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:44.890
Then I shall become the world's King.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:52.390
Once past fifty, must death await me?

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:57.330
I intended to compromise with you.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:05.610
Fifty years of human life...

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:15.190
Compared to the heavens...

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:33.940
It is but a dream and illusion...

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:38.670
As of now, you are unable to overcome mere imitation.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:53.760
Once given immortality, does death even exist?

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:58.490
Mere imitation by a monkey is fine with me!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.180
I shall imitate Lord Nobunaga until the bitter end!

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:06.500
I shall spread his ideals far and wide!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:10.950
End of May - Imperial Capital, Uchino

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:28.260
This administrative center is named Jurakudai.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:32.500
The base was supposed to be set up at Osaka castle.

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:37.220
The emperor did not want to move, so the Chief Advisor accepted the move here.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:42.190
Thanks to that, I am able to build this grand masterpiece.

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:45.530
I would not have enough funds to build it myself.

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:50.610
It is because the Chief Advisor is also building a golden buddha in the eastern mountains.

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:54.490
As he expands his beauty, so too does he expands his ugliness.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.700
These thick lines display such austere elegance.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:24.440
As expected of the expert painter recommended by the master, Hasegawa Tōhaku.

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:27.840
Master Oribe.

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.320
Thank you for coming all the way out here.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:31.900
It's no problem.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:35.910
I cannot believe you are having trouble feeding yourself with such skills.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.470
Being a painter is tough.

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:40.290
Like you said,

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.700
the painting industry has been monopolized by the Kanō school.

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:48.400
I am able to accept this job only with the backing of Master Rikyū.

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:57.100
Your look of anguish just ups my anticipation level.

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.300
Please display your utmost abilities.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:03.750
Your art shall represent our new daimyo's mansion.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:07.920
This is...

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.880
Something for you to work off of.

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:14.010
You are free to draw whatever subject you want,

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:17.600
but it may help you to know my preferences.

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:23.490
This is something amazing...

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:26.000
This is Mino pottery.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:29.330
Still quite a bit off from that "ka-ching" feeling.

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:30.660
"Ka-ching?"

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.770
This mansion won't be just any old mansion.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.960
This will be my first masterpiece.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.890
The Jurakudai will be situated in the middle of Japan.

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.620
Many people will come visit it when it is complete.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:48.750
If those visitors do not feel a shiver from the bottom of their hearts,

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:50.730
then all of this would have been for naught.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:56.590
The yard, the gates, along with each and every tile must display utmost simplicity.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:58.000
Listen, Master Tōhaku.

00:14:58.630 --> 00:14:59.670
This is war!

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:00.860
War!?

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:05.910
You will use those brushes and crush the Kanō school.

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:12.020
My correct judgement shall shock all those bigwigs.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.980
I shall rule over all of the aesthetes!

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:20.860
June, 1586 - Settsu Province, Osaka Castle

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:27.750
As the envoy for Tokugawa, you have come a far way,

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.050
Lord Sakakibara.

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:33.330
I, Sakakibara Yasumasa,

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.330
have already spoken with Lord Hideyoshi.

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:39.930
Lord Ieyasu will not become a part of the Toyotomi clan.

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:44.420
We will not become like Lord Nishikawa and worship two masters.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.720
It does not matter how much you try and persuade me.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.860
Here is a little something.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.150
Please bring this back to Hamamatsu.

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:06.900
This is quite an interesting tea bowl.
It looks like a used sake wood container.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:11.610
Quite a waste to give this to Lord Tokugawa, Master Rikyū.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:16.250
I had them make a bigger one, fitting for a warrior.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:20.250
I also have the same one prepared for Lord Ishikawa.

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.250
My master may enjoy tea,

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:27.360
but I cannot say whether he will like a old bowl like this.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:29.200
An old bowl, you say?

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:32.560
Do you not understand the charm of what you are holding?

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:37.000
You have changed, Lord Ishikawa.

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:40.520
Warriors do not need charm.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:44.040
Have you lost your edge after defecting to Toyotomi?

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.010
Listen, Yasumasa.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:57.130
Take a look at the flowers while you are still young.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.900
You may feel that you have plenty of time left,

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:07.380
but I guarantee the number of times you have truly looked at them number less than ten.

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.500
If you stay with Tokugawa,

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.610
that number will be reduced to less than three.

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.410
Are you fine with that?

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:19.650
Think about your children.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:22.700
You won't even be able to explain the beauty of the cherry blossoms to them.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:26.760
Will your life truly be complete?

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:42.040
Please explain my feelings properly to Ieyasu.

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:45.760
I'll include a letter.

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:49.860
Please make sure Ieyasu gets this tea bowl.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:55.030
I just can't get enough of this!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.670
How much are you willing to sell it for?

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:02.600
I am sorry, but this is not for sale.

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:07.240
I just felt happy, seeing something like this produced.

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:12.840
I wanted to share that bit of happiness with everyone, that's all.

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:27.230
I can understand what those merchants are feeling.

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:31.350
I have heard about the perfection of this square shape.

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:33.710
That's why I came all the way out here to see it.

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:38.810
I'm sure they are quite mad right now.

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:42.830
I have the same thing prepared for you, Master Furuori.

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.020
Please take it with you.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:52.000
Master, there is a letter for you from the shipping company at Echizen.

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:55.720
"The square-shaped black tea bowl has been highly praised.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:19:00.010
Can you sell it to us for 700 kan?"

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:01.860
700 kan!?

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:05.320
A single imayaki pottery can be sold at the price of a small castle!?

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:10.340
We shall have to reject that offer.

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:15.170
There are only three of its kind left.

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:19.000
Tell them we would like 800 kan.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:19.550
All right.

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:21.750
I understand.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.760
Your ways of dealing.

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:27.560
When a new tea bowl is made,

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:33.220
you then wait for the news to spread.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:36.610
Then you show it the public.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.780
You refuse to sell it to potential buyers.

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:42.480
You wait for the price to slowly rise.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:46.610
You then sell it at the highest price possible.

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.470
Something like that, I surmise?

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:52.660
I have two reasons for this.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:58.430
One, it is very expensive to create more tea bowls.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.580
In order to guarantee its quality,

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:04.220
the process involves more than ten steps and a large number of artisans.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:09.920
I received from the Chief Advisor a stipend of 3,000 koku.

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:13.320
That is not enough to maintain a pottery room.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:14.850
I understand.

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:19.130
I also put plenty into the 10 works of Oribe.

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:20.940
One more reason.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:26.260
I must have this Imayaki pottery become the best tea bowl in the world.

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:31.540
I have put all that I value within it.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:37.020
I want people to underestand the beauty of imperfection.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:41.620
I cannot let it be valued less than some foreign good.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:55.500
But you have already been named by the Emperor.

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:58.050
Now you are dealing in sales as a Buddhist named Rikyū.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:01.830
Doesn't that go against the scriptures?

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:16.310
The Chief Advisor had agreed to my business before me becoming the Master of Tea.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:20.350
Thank you for your concerns.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.810
I heard from Master Tōhaku.

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:33.600
You want to make the Jurakudai the number one mansion in the world?

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:39.220
Well... That's a bit embarrassing to say in front of you.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:45.680
I don't really have any good ideas once I think about it.

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:48.980
Why don't you take a trip to Yamashina?

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:50.220
Yamashina?

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:53.080
A famous man lives there.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:57.050
He is the best purveyor of imperfection I have ever known.

00:21:57.690 --> 00:21:58.390
The best!?

00:22:02.890 --> 00:22:03.520
Master?

00:22:11.090 --> 00:22:12.220
I am looking forward to it.

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:15.590
I hope you can make a fabulous mansion.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:40.080
He has aged, and yet his karma is deeper than ever before.

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:45.780
If I want to rule the world as an aesthete,

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:47.730
will that day come...

00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:52.420
When I have to surpass that monster?

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:06.200
Everytime I　

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:06.200
Anata no mune

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:08.590
feel your heart

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:08.590
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.680
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.680
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:20.860
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:20.860
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:27.020
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:27.020
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:33.110
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:33.110
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:36.990
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:36.990
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.570
