00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.570
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:46.440
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:46.440
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.540 --> 00:23:49.440
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.540 --> 00:23:49.440
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:52.050
Without each other.

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:52.050
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:53.010
You should

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:53.010
Soshite

